+ * calibration in bits [23:0]:
+ *
+ *   word  0     : golden temp, MCU controller 0 RC calibration
+ *   words 1-4   : MCU controller 0 sensors 0-3 (big CPUs)
+ *   word  5     : MCU controller 1 RC calibration
+ *   words 6-9   : MCU controller 1 sensors 0-3 (little CPUs)
+ *   word  10    : MCU controller 2 RC calibration
+ *   words 11-14 : MCU controller 2 sensors 0-3 (little CPUs)
+ *   word  15    : AP controller 0 RC calibration
+ *   words 16-19 : AP controller 0 sensors 0-3 (SoC top, APU)
+ *   word  20    : AP (MFG) controller 1 RC calibration
+ *   words 21-22 : AP (MFG) controller 1 sensors 0-1 (GPU)
+ */
